  (text "TONE -- IC3 TL074. A: input buffer. PASSIVE JAMES bass/treble network (the Thomas-Vox topology: panel Bass + Treble pots; ~flat at noon with a slight bright tilt, bass +-6 dB @100 Hz, treble +6/-16 dB @10 kHz -- more cut than boost, as the originals). B: make-up gain x2 (network loss). C: gyrator MID CUT (-10 dB @ ~790 Hz, Q~0.6, SW_MID toggle in the line-reverse hole). D: output buffer -> Volume (470 pF chime/bright cap) -> TONE_OUT. All about VBIAS_3. spice/sweep_tonestack.cir" (at 70.48 17.46 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid 129126c8-5309-43f1-af84-db695924a49a))
